						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10235#msg10235"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10235#msg10235">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #64 on:</b> August 19, 2004, 11:03:36 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I often wonder about other people&#039;s reading comprehension.&nbsp; &nbsp; For the few that weren&#039;t swift enough,&nbsp; I simply stated Hegemony didn&#039;t do anything wrong in engaging Grummus.&nbsp; I did point out that showing courtesy isn&#039;t part of raiding, only player/guild style or lack thereof.<br /><br />It is also just as obvious that there are many people who were not participating in the raid that came to the same conclusion.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
