							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10248#msg10248"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10248#msg10248">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #66 on:</b> August 19, 2004, 01:39:21 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							hey ya bearbutt nice to hear from ya.&nbsp; Haven&#039;t seen ya in a while.&nbsp; Ya I remeber them days but to complain about loosing a mob when your not in a zone or have started pulling is a bit stupid.&nbsp; My guess is the alliance wasn&#039;t ready when hegemony went by or they would have ran into to go after grummus.&nbsp; Instead they say thats messed up you took our mob when they werent in the zone or my guess is they didn&#039;t have the numbers or the right people to take grummus down.&nbsp; Yes bearbutt HoT is the awsomest ever hehe.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
