	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10254"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=309" title="View the profile of Roinin">Roinin</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 16<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=309"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10254#msg10254"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=840.msg10254#msg10254">Re: Rant re Ialin on Hegemony Raid</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #67 on:</b> August 19, 2004, 03:18:01 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">On that night, the perception was Hegemony acted like a bunch of asses lacking any style or common courtesy.</div><br />The raid only does what the Raid Leader tells it to, we&#039;ve become accustomed to a certain style of raiding and it&#039;s a basic formula we follow. I&#039;m sure you, as among other guilds, have a system you follow for setting up or moving to different zones, and can somewhat relate. Now If I said, &quot;get to Dalnir now&quot;, you&#039;d see people there within 10 minutes. So,&nbsp; people were only following my orders to move to Grummus.&nbsp; Had I not been rebooting, like i said in my previous post, things may have been different, but it&#039;s easy to say that in hindsight. <br /><br />I&#039;ve already posted an apoligy, gave my reasons why it happened, and offered an explanation. I&#039;ve already said I was responsible for the events, if that doesn&#039;t suffice, I&#039;m not sure what else you want, or want to hear frankly.<br />People in raid aren&#039;t going to sit around waiting for me to get back from rebooting, questioning my moral decisions. Jumping someone or pulling otherwise shady tactics isn&#039;t Hegemony&#039;s style. Sure, we race other guilds to mobs all the time,&nbsp; but such wasn&#039;t the intentions that night, seeing as I didnt even know about this &quot;alliance&quot; sitting outside , until after I got back from rebooting anyways.<br /><br />As you progress through PoP, you&#039;ll soon find the&nbsp; upper teir mobs are highly contested. If you want these mobs, you&#039;ll have to move to them as quickly as possible, perhaps even raicing another guild(s) to them. If you degrade to calling every guild that beats you to these mobs as <div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> acted like a bunch of asses lacking any style or common courtesy.</div> , then you will soon find yourselves very bitter and in severely lacking progression or kills. Now, I&#039;m not justifying my or my guild&#039;s actions, I&#039;m just letting you know what&#039;s to come as you progress.&nbsp; But, again, good luck to you in your future endevours through the planes.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=266327" target="_blank">Roinin Unsleep</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
